# ScrollBench Phase 3.2 Walkthrough

## Summary

Successfully completed Phase 3.2 of ScrollBench development: Share Dialog implementation. Overcame file corruption issues and created comprehensive git commit documenting ScrollBench as a parallel test application.

## Changes Made

### ShareDialog Component Created
Created [test_scrollbench/qml/ShareDialog.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/qml/ShareDialog.qml) with three resize options:
- **Resize for Email (Small)**: 1024x768 @ 80% quality preset
- **Resize for Email (Manual)**: Opens advanced editor (Phase 3.3)
- **Share Original Size**: Share without modifications
- **Cancel**: Close dialog

### MainScrollBench.qml Rebuilt
File became corrupted during edits and had to be completely rewritten from scratch:
- ✅ All features preserved
- ✅ ShareDialog integrated
- ✅ Share button wired to `shareDialog.open()`
- ✅ Default thumbnail resolution: 192px (per user specification)
- ✅ Build successful

### Documentation Added
Created [docs/SCROLLBENCH_STRATEGY.md](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/docs/SCROLLBENCH_STRATEGY.md) explaining:
- ScrollBench purpose as parallel test app
- Development process (build to parity → merge features → deprecate)
- Key differences from main app
- Commit strategy

