## Notes

- **Thumb Resolution**: Changed default from 256px → 192px per user spec
- **Downsampling**: Images must be downsampled to match thumb resolution
- **Main App Safety**: No changes to production app, remains at v2.1.0
- **Tandem Development**: ScrollBench builds features, main app stays stable
